OMR engines and models (separate processes, invoked as tools)
-------------------------------------------------------------
* Audiveris 5.11 — AGPL-3.0
  https://github.com/Audiveris/audiveris
  The Linux .deb bundles a Java runtime.  This repository invokes the
  unmodified binary via subprocess and does not link it into the Python code.
* homr 0.7 — AGPL-3.0
  https://github.com/liebharc/homr
  Installed into the worker image; its ONNX/OCR weights are downloaded by
  `homr --init` and remain under homr's own licence.
* oemer — optional legacy CLI adapter only; see upstream for its licence.
  https://github.com/BreezeWhite/oemer

